  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "2.0.1-beta — Breaking changes (caution advised):\n\nThis release removes all reflection-based internal logic, streamlines several APIs, and shifts registration behavior to source-generation-first. Although the new approach is simpler and safer, these are breaking changes — please review the updated documentation before upgrading.\n\n• Removed all reflection usage throughout the framework\n• Streamlined/consolidated internal and public APIs\n• All registration container behavior migrated to source-generator-first\n• CacheEntry.Timestamp changed from readonly to { get; set }\n• Cache now uses TryAdd (first-instance policy)\n• ShouldPersistInHistory() replaced by RecordInHistory property\n• Added [NavigationTarget], [DialogTarget], [DialogWindow], [ViewModelLocator], and DI attributes\n• Added AddGeneratedRegistrations() entry point\n• Added strongly-typed ViewModelLocator with generated properties",
